{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54667","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日光晕，晕珥有阴风。\n左右并同爲吉兆，三般变动日时逢（京本作「同」），日月在罗笼。\n（日边耳，经曰：日有抱晕於野，皆有降军降将至也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}